  "name": "Suger",
  "url": "https://apiv2.suger.cloud/mcp",
  "description": "Suger is the cloud go-to-market platform for software companies selling through the AWS, Azure, and GCP marketplaces. This connector gives Claude secure, OAuth-authenticated access to your Suger account so you can run marketplace operations in natural language.\n  \n  Capabilities:\n  • Products & offers — create, update, and publish public and private offers and offer sets across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n  • Buyers & contacts — look up and manage buyer accounts, contacts, and credit wallets.\n  • Entitlements & subscriptions — inspect, approve, cancel, and adjust entitlements and entitlement terms.\n  • Usage metering & billing — report and validate usage records, manage billable metrics, and configure metering.\n  • Revenue — query unified revenue records, daily revenue, and revenue reports across all connected marketplaces.\n  • Co-sell — create, update, validate, and sync co-sell referrals with AWS ACE, Azure Partner Center, and GCP, and view co-sell dashboards.\n  • Support & notifications — create and manage support tickets and review notification events.\n  • Knowledge — search AWS, Azure, GCP, and Suger marketplace documentation.\n  \n  All actions run against your own Suger account using your existing permissions. Read-only tools (lookups, lists, reports) run without a confirmation prompt; tools that create, modify, or delete data always ask for confirmation first.",
